    <string name="tmdb_info">Clean backdrops and title logos for the films and shows on your apps\' home screen cards, in place of their own art and stickers. It works without a key, from Stremio\'s free data; TMDB is the official, more reliable source.\n\nFree key: themoviedb.org → Settings → API → personal use.</string>
    <string name="youtube_info">With SmartTube signed in, the YouTube tile shows videos from your own YouTube feed. No key needed.\n\nWithout it, a key shows the most popular videos in your country. Free key: console.cloud.google.com → new project → enable YouTube Data API v3 → Credentials → Create API key.\n\nWith neither, it shows trailers of popular films.</string>
