    <string name="plex_info">Backdrops from your own Plex server: Continue Watching and recently added.\n\nTo find it: app.plex.tv → open any title → ⋯ → Get Info → View XML, and copy what follows X-Plex-Token= in the address. Keep it private, like a password.</string>
